# Keep the working tree LF on every platform.
#
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true on Windows produces a CRLF working tree while
# gci and gofumpt normalise to LF — so `task lint` reports every Go file as
# unformatted locally while CI (which checks out on Linux) reports none of it.
# A quality gate that is always red gets ignored, which is how a real finding
# gets missed.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
